# AppleDouble files created by the SanDisk/exFAT volume — never commit these
._*
.omx/

# Secrets — private signing keys must NEVER be committed. The update-signing
# private key lives only in CI (secret UPDATE_SIGNING_KEY); update_pub.pem is
# baked into the agent source. (update_pub.pem itself is public and safe.)
*_priv.pem
update_priv.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
